---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About My Sorted Nest — practical home organization ideas for small spaces, apartments, closets and kitchens.">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="font-body-compact text-body-compact text-on-surface-variant mb-space-md">
<a href="/" class="hover:text-on-surface transition-colors">Home</a><span class="mx-2">/</span><span class="text-on-surface">About</span>
</nav>

<section class="py-space-lg">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center">
<div class="lg:col-span-7">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">About</span>
<h1 class="font-display-hero text-display-hero-mobile lg:text-headline-lg text-on-surface mt-space-sm mb-space-md leading-tight">A calmer home, one small space at a time.</h1>
<p class="font-body-lead text-body-lead text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl">My Sorted Nest is a home organization blog for people who live in real homes — small apartments, packed closets, tiny kitchens, and rooms that have to do double duty.</p>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5">
<div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-surface-container aspect-[4/3]">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" src="/images/about.jpg" alt="Warm, organized home reading corner" />
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="py-space-lg">
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-space-lg">Everything here follows three rules</h2>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-gutter">
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[32px]">home</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mt-space-sm mb-space-xs">No renovations required</h3>
<p class="font-body-regular text-body-regular text-on-surface-variant">Every idea works for renters and anyone who can't — or won't — knock down walls.</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[32px]">savings</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mt-space-sm mb-space-xs">No big budgets</h3>
<p class="font-body-regular text-body-regular text-on-surface-variant">We focus on affordable storage, clever reuse, and systems that cost little but change a lot.</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl p-space-lg shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[32px]">check_circle</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface mt-space-sm mb-space-xs">Actually doable</h3>
<p class="font-body-regular text-body-regular text-on-surface-variant">If an idea takes a whole weekend and three power tools, it doesn't belong here.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="py-space-lg max-w-[680px]">
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-space-md">Why small spaces?</h2>
<div class="article-body">
<p>Small-space organization is where the interesting problems live. Anyone can organize a walk-in closet the size of a bedroom. Fitting a week's groceries, cleaning supplies, and small appliances into a 2-foot-wide pantry — that's a design challenge. We like those.</p>
<h2>What you'll find</h2>
<p>Room-by-room organization guides, storage hacks, closet and kitchen systems, and seasonal decluttering plans. New ideas every week — researched, original, and written to actually work in a rental.</p>
<h2>How we work</h2>
<p>Every guide is researched from scratch and written for usefulness first: specific measurements, real product types, and honest notes on what <em>doesn't</em> work. No copied content, no filler — if a section doesn't help you organize something, it gets cut.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-space-lg flex flex-wrap gap-space-sm">
<a href="/blog/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-primary text-on-primary hover:bg-primary-container hover:text-on-primary-container px-7 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-label-regular text-label-regular tracking-wide transition-colors">Browse the guides</a>
<a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-3.5 rounded-lg font-label-regular text-label-regular border border-outline-variant hover:border-primary transition-colors">Get in touch</a>
</div>
</section>
</Layout>
